---
/**
 * Case Studies — side-by-side cards with result metrics.
 * Shows before→after transformation with quantifiable results.
 * Positioned after HowItWorks, before mid-page CTA.
 * Hardcoded content — no props needed.
 */
---

<section id="case-studies" class="relative not-prose scroll-mt-[72px]">
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 md:px-6 py-16 md:py-24 lg:py-32">

    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="mb-10 md:mb-14 intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-default">
        Results in the real world
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-muted">
        Here's what changed for businesses like yours.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

      <!-- Card 1 — Construction -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border-l-4 border-l-accent border border-slate-100 bg-white shadow-sm p-6 md:p-8 intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-label font-mono text-muted block mb-4">
          Construction &middot; 45 employees
        </span>
        <p class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">
          15 hrs/week saved
        </p>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-muted mb-6">
          Twelve spreadsheets tracked jobs, costs, and crew hours &mdash; none of them agreed.
          We replaced them with one live dashboard updated automatically from their existing tools.
        </p>
        <blockquote class="border-none pl-0">
          <p class="font-display italic text-base text-default mb-3">
            &ldquo;I used to spend every Friday night reconciling numbers. Now I check my phone
            on Monday morning and know exactly where every job stands.&rdquo;
          </p>
          <footer class="text-sm text-muted">
            &mdash; Operations Manager, Regional GC
          </footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 — Apparel Manufacturing -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-white shadow-sm p-6 md:p-8 intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-label font-mono text-muted block mb-4">
          Apparel Manufacturing &middot; 60 employees
        </span>
        <p class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">
          $340K in recovered margin
        </p>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-muted mb-6">
          Pricing decisions were based on gut feel and outdated cost sheets. We built margin
          visibility by product line so they could see which styles were actually profitable.
        </p>
        <blockquote class="border-none pl-0">
          <p class="font-display italic text-base text-default mb-3">
            &ldquo;We found three product lines we'd been losing money on for over a year.
            That one insight paid for the entire engagement.&rdquo;
          </p>
          <footer class="text-sm text-muted">
            &mdash; CEO, Apparel Manufacturer
          </footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
